  <item>
    <title>请节目、买榜单、搞内卷：如何管住地方政府乱花钱的手？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a2fcc4743a22a695584258d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a2fcc4743a22a695584258d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 10:06:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近，有地方花850万请跑男做文旅宣传，更有县市花近千万买百强县排名。那么，政府该不该花钱买流量、买排名？如何管住地方政府乱花钱的手？</span></p><p><span>本期看点：</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a></span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><span>县级市花850万请跑男做文旅宣传，这钱该不该花？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a></span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><span>政府购买服务外包，为什么说“有条件同意”？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="161">02:41</a></span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><span>文旅“内卷”真是好事？立项为何总被“先拍板再走流程”？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="162">02:42</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a></span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><span>文旅宣传的效果怎么评估？经济学家有个“一招鲜”的方法你知道吗？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a></span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><span>张艺谋的印象系列也亏过钱？请大腕不等于包赚钱？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a></span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><span>已是旅游强县，还有必要花钱买流量吗？招标公告里的“单一来源”藏着什么猫腻？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a></span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><span>更离谱的事来了：花近千万买百强县排名，花钱和上榜没关系你信吗？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="534">08:54</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a></span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><span>不花钱也能有好名声？稻城亚丁“拦路收费”给我们什么教训？</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a></span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><span>财政压力下，如何管住地方政府乱花钱的手？三个办法你支持哪个？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65a0fdba77db6aceef1e96a5/ljLm3oqTFGyLt_Pv7uCKo1T_n4aT.m4a" length="12244678" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:12:36</itunes:duration>
