  <item>
    <title>从合肥模式到追觅“崩老头”：政企合作的边界如何把握？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a0d8605e1eb34a939c3cae6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a0d8605e1eb34a939c3cae6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 10:08:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近，年销150亿的追觅公司喊出“三年破万亿”的口号，手段不是靠风投，而是精准瞄准地方政府的招商需求。旗下200多个事业部横跨机器人、辣条、奶茶，被媒体称为“崩老头”——像假扮女性骗取打赏一样，拿捏官员的KPI焦虑。</span></p><p><span>PPP造车、光伏骗补、“假央企”背书、数据造假，在地方招商引资过程中可谓乱象丛生。为什么会出现这些乱象？是企业主的道德沦丧，还是KPI驱动下各类当事人的人性扭曲？是市场失灵，还是体制问题？这期内容聂老师从政治经济学的角度，谈谈对这一类现象的看法。</span></p><p><span>本期看点：</span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a></span></strong><span>  </span><strong><span>一家公司喊出“三年破万亿”，究竟是商业奇迹还是“崩老头”骗局？</span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="310">05:10</a></span></strong><span>  </span><strong><span>从“七通一平”到税收内卷：地方政府为何明知亏本还要拼命招商？</span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="486">08:06</a></span></strong><span>  </span><strong><span>基金招商与“反投机制”：合肥模式是神话还是更大规模的赌博？</span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a></span></strong><span>  </span><strong><span>追觅如何“精准命中”十几个地方政府？政企合谋为何可能变成双输？</span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">11:14</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a></span></strong><span>  </span><strong><span>政府亲自下场搞风投：是激励扭曲，还是体制问题？</span></strong><span>  </span></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a></span></strong><strong><span> - </span></strong><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="982">16:22</a></span></strong><span>  </span><strong><span>如何避免下一场“崩老头”骗局？</span></strong><br><br></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65a0fdba77db6aceef1e96a5/lijFFU5DUatk0secPAnDhDeLGIFG.m4a" length="17063987" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:17:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv3brdzh34lGy2QQWYLb70XhAHGw.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>张雪的成功，说明穷人逆袭不能光靠自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d08bc0e2c8be3155588226</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d08bc0e2c8be3155588226</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 Apr 2026 03:58:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>经济下行，寒门还能出贵子吗？张雪，初中毕业、净身出户，却把摩托车卖到7.5亿。他的逆袭靠的不仅是“霸蛮”——为什么说穷人翻身不能光靠自己？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的穷人是否还有逆袭的机会？穷人依靠什么因素才能实现逆袭？既然逆袭会成功，为什么世上那么多穷人总是穷？如果我们知道穷人之所以穷的原因了，应该如何从制度上为更多穷人创造逆袭的机会呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你是一个普通人（家里没矿），又不属于县城“婆罗门”，或者非常关心阶层跃升，那么你今天要听听聂老师的分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期看点：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>张雪峰“英年早逝”？张雪机车夺冠——一个动口一个动手，谁对穷人帮助更大？</span></p><span></span><p><span>努力还能改变命运吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>聂老师：世界上只有一种病，叫穷病。</span></p><span></span><p><span>穷人今天还有逆袭的机会吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">03:11</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>初中生修车学徒，冒雨追电视台100多公里，就为一个镜头。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个普通人凭什么让湖南卫视给他补拍？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="191">03:11</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">04:58</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>净身出户、不要股票不要分红，如今公司估值10个亿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他做对了哪件事，让投资人连夜去堵门？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">04:58</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>哈佛商学院院训：make a difference。按部就班读书买房，是梦想还是做梦？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是那个“不普通的人”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>台风天男子扶货车被压死：贫穷最悲哀的地方是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>穷，真的是因为自己不行吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">10:11</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>有人出生在罗马，有人生来是牛马——孟加拉国给一半穷人发奶牛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>发奶牛就能让穷人翻身吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">10:11</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="683">11:23</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>实验结论：钱给少了反而害人，必须一次性给够临界值。</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么说“穷本身就是穷的原因”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="683">11:23</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>全国85%的打印店都是湖南新化人开的，抱团取暖的秘密。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你的社会网络，决定你能走多远？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>AI最擅长推理和数据分析，却学不会张雪的“非理性”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>张雪和张雪峰，你认为谁对穷人帮助更大？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65a0fdba77db6aceef1e96a5/lnXYrSBkAqVLhouhS9ltr5wSgHVD.m4a" length="14157404" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:14:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FulXDpTzw693IKy-x0ExPeYEG2sm.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>考公还是年轻人的最优解吗？——聂辉华对谈马督工（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696f4955ef1cf272a76f454d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696f4955ef1cf272a76f454d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Jan 2026 09:44:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>经济转型期，青年就业难在哪？考公真是最优解吗？基层治理、政企关系如何看懂？本期对谈为你拆解答案！</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 时间轴 -</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>年轻人“降低预期”要降到什么水平？经济增速变缓，职业规划该锚定什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>经济从8%降到3%，就业会受多大影响？大国长期稳定增长需哪些前提？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>经济下行期，年轻人该提升哪些技能？学好英语、多看历史真能破局吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>青年失业率17%算严重吗？AI替代工作后，普通人收入如何保障？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>年轻人扎堆考公，从社会角度看是最优选择吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>体制内外福利差距悬殊合理吗？公务员的“铁饭碗”未来还保得住吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1048">17:28</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025年考编成功的年轻人，未来会经历怎样的发展轨迹？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1048">17:28</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>基层工作最实用的知识是什么？哪些作品能真正看懂基层治理？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>县委书记为何是高危职业？普通公务员如何规避风险？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>基层调研想挖真话，该怎么和干部拉近距离？当代有靠谱的官场实录吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1741">29:01</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>官员“政商旋转门”该鼓励吗？政企关系为何会从合作变“互害”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1741">29:01</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;官员异地任职+短任期，会影响地方长期发展吗？哪些地区政商环境最好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>负面新闻频发的郑州，为何能获评政商亲近指数第一？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1973">32:53</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>中国社会最有价值的核心问题有哪些？对接基层/考公需掌握哪些逻辑？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65a0fdba77db6aceef1e96a5/llTpEcazpZ9G3hSpB8IdmY3J5dyx.m4a" length="34261426" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:16</itunes:duration>
