  <item>
    <title>如何看待适应信息集权时代？——聂辉华对谈马督工（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696c9148109824f9e11c163c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696c9148109824f9e11c163c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 18 Jan 2026 10:20:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>为何说“非正式制度”才是理解基层的关键？等级社会如何运行？普通人该学什么经济学？</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 时间轴 -</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>选择稳定还是冒险？一代人的集体记忆如何塑造了他们的学术视角？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="124">02:04</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>童年的饥饿感，如何塑造了一位经济学家的学术烙印与梦想？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>当法律遇上人情，基层社会真正的运行规则是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>在时代的风口上，一个农村状元为何“逆势”选择了经济学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="284">04:44</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>学者的研究报告，真的能撬动国家层面的制度变革吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">06:14</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">07:34</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>从学术论文到中央批示，经济学研究是怎样影响国家决策的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">09:31</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>决定你城市命运的，是市场规律还是行政等级？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="572">09:32</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="661">11:01</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么说中国城市的兴衰史，首先是一部政治地位变迁史？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="662">11:02</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">12:31</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>城市竞争，应该完全“自由放任”吗？为何教授说前提是公平？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>王朝的强盛与崩溃，背后是集权与分权怎样的动态博弈？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>大数据时代，中央对地方了如指掌，基层的自主权会消失吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>中国持续发展的密码，是“上面指挥”还是“下面创新”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1046">17:26</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1196">19:56</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>未来的县域，是否应该分成“企业家”和“管理员”两种模式？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">19:57</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1314">21:54</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么相邻地区总难合作？政治经济学告诉你“零和博弈”的真相。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1405">23:25</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>研究中国问题，为什么必须换一套和西方完全不同的思维模型？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1538">25:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>平台经济的繁荣，该不该以牺牲骑手社保为代价？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1539">25:39</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1707">28:27</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>大厂“掐尖式”收购，是否正在扼杀中国的创新未来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1708">28:28</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1883">31:23</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>没有工业底子的旅游火爆，是昙花一现还是可持续模式？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1884">31:24</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2029">33:49</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>风景绝美却依然贫困，为什么说这是“治理能力”的断层？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2133">35:33</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>不想做研究也不想改政策，普通人学经济学到底有什么用？</span></p>]]></description>
