  <item>
    <title>工人被AI替代怎么办？对AI征税！【聂辉华教授】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6936a1db4ef12f9fe98b41cc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6936a1db4ef12f9fe98b41cc</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Dec 2025 10:09:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近，河南省老君山风景区因为一个“反常”决定火了。在很多景区都在使用无人机这种高科技运货上山的背景下，该景区明确拒绝用无人机取代挑山工。我的观点：老君山风景区的做法是一个温馨的故事，但不具有普遍性，而且并没有真正解决问题。我在想，有没有一种更好的方案，既能将货品安全送到山顶，同时又能不让年老的挑山工失业，或者得到合理的收入？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>景区拒绝高科技是情怀还是保守？——从老君山坚持使用挑山工说起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>把挑山工当作“风景”，是否是一种残忍？——人道视角下的质疑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>有没有两全其美的办法？——提出“对无人机征税，补偿挑山工”的方案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么要对AI征税？——从卢德运动到今日争议的逻辑起点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>比尔·盖茨为何支持机器人税？——税负公平的视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>税收应该减少扭曲还是纠正外部性？——最优税收理论与失业的社会成本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>机器换人不可逆，税基萎缩怎么办？——从成本趋势到规模优势的现实趋势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>未来如果大部分人不用工作，谁來缴税？——从税基萎缩到“机器人税”的必然性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>不工作的人靠什么生活？——全民基本收入（UBI）是乌托邦吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="691">11:31</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>直接发钱会影响工作积极性吗？——来自OpenAI CEO的社会实验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="764">12:44</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>学术研究如何支持对机器人征税？——顶级期刊上的严谨结论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>反对征收机器人税的理由站得住脚吗？——从纳税主体到创新抑制的争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="935">15:35</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>机器人税具体怎么收？——可能的税种与实施路径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是否正走向一个靠考试决定命运的反乌托邦？——本期的思考题</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65a0fdba77db6aceef1e96a5/ljD-x3AgfwQbA9_iEUqkxM9K1sq0.m4a" length="16876300" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:17:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh14YfxmLlCgfSAmNJR7Jl09BJ4d.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>人大聂辉华:找熟人，靠强人，用狠人真的就能在基层高枕无忧了吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6904869c48dbe0eb56c80c9c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6904869c48dbe0eb56c80c9c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 Oct 2025 10:03:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>49岁堂哥倒在创业路上，农学女硕士回农村种地，贪心村民巧设连环计。以上两个案例都表明，基层创业套路多。怎么避雷？基层工作者怎么开展工作？这期视频我来谈谈我的观点。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>基层创业套路多，怎么避雷？基层工作者怎么开展工作？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">02:11</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>日薪 300 的老闺蜜摸鱼队：是谁在拿捏新手的命脉？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">03:54</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>正式制度 vs. 不完全契约：农村=“文字游戏”修罗场？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="234">03:54</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>熟人、强人、狠人——基层通关的“三位一体”外挂？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>同心圆文化：为什么回村第一件事是“盘关系”？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="409">06:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>强人登场：村长家的地=“免坑金牌”？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="474">07:54</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>狠人家族：乡村干部真的是“打”出来的？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>请神容易送神难：用狠人反噬的临界点在哪？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025 反腐数据大曝光：为何“小官”立案数是“大老虎”的 800 倍？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>菩萨心肠+金刚手段：好人到底能不能在农村活下去？</span></p>]]></description>
